@startuml
!include theme.puml
hide footbox
autonumber
actor Client
participant "client-api" as api
participant "Aggregator" as agg
participant "PVMBG" as source
par Worker polling
agg -> source : GET dengan timeout 4 s
source --> agg : delay 3 s / error
agg -> agg : ingest dan update status\ndi PostgreSQL
else Jalur baca independen
Client -> api : GET seismic / volcanic + JWT
api -> api : scope dan batas beban
api -> agg : query internal\nbudget 1,5 s
agg -> agg : query PostgreSQL\npool baca terpisah
agg --> api : data + status sumber
api -> api : proyeksi allowlist
api --> Client : 200 / galat eksplisit
end
note over api,agg
Request baca tidak menunggu HTTP sumber.
Akses PostgreSQL diringkas di sini;
lihat diagram arsitektur untuk batas container.
end note
@enduml
